pid Travel, Where There Be Dragons, ARCC Programs, Rustic Pathways, Stray Travel, Dragoman, Broadreach, NOLS, Outward Bound ## Task For each employer found, note: LIVE job posting | seasonal recruiter | careers page only. ## Output format Return a markdown table with exactly these columns: | Company | Region | Role title(s) | Careers / jobs URL | Typical trip length | Hiring signal | Why similar to anchors | Find **10 distinct employers** (quality over quantity). At the end, list the 3 best-matched for Haka Tours-style driver-guiding AND Pacific Discovery-style field instructing. 
